# Keep the build context minimal and free of local or secret files.
# Docker matches patterns from the context root only, so each one starts
# with **/ to apply at every depth.

# Version control
**/.git

# Local AI assistant files (never in an image)
**/.claude
**/CLAUDE.md
**/AGENTS.md

# Environment and secrets: the last matching rule wins, so the
# exception for the example file must come after the broad pattern
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Dependencies and build outputs
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Test and tooling output
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

# Logs
**/*.log

# Private theme of a deployment (git-ignored): a deployment passes it as a build override
**/theme.local.css

# Runtime data
**/postgres-data
**/uploads
**/storage
# The client source folders named storage are tracked code, not runtime data
!apps/client/src/**/storage

# Editors and OS
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
